WEBVTT

00:01:00.389 --> 00:01:02.975
I hate that story.

00:01:03.559 --> 00:01:05.186
But I share it

00:01:05.228 --> 00:01:08.689
because we can't solve what we can't see.

00:01:10.024 --> 00:01:12.360
In 1936,

00:01:12.401 --> 00:01:14.737
this image of the migrant mother

00:01:14.779 --> 00:01:16.823
captured the living
conditions in the West,

00:01:16.823 --> 00:01:19.700
showing lawmakers
what people were going through.

00:01:20.284 --> 00:01:21.452
After it published,

00:01:21.494 --> 00:01:24.580
the United States government
sent 20,000 pounds of food,

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:26.499
and that image solidified support

00:01:26.541 --> 00:01:29.210
for the very first safety-net
programs in America.